      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "abusive_meme_intent",
      "label": "Intent to mock or insult through violent language",
      "description": "The meme uses violent, threatening language ('kill them', 'kill them all !!!!!') to mock or insult the Queen. This is not a literal call to violence but a form of abusive internet humor that targets a public figure by associating her with extreme violence. The intent is to provoke outrage or shock, and it constitutes an abusive meme targeting an individual based on her status and identity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
