      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "internet_meme_culture",
      "label": "Context of internet meme culture and abusive content",
      "description": "This meme is part of a broader internet culture where images are often manipulated with text to create humorous, shocking, or abusive content. The use of a revered figure like the Queen with violent text is a common tactic in abusive memes to provoke strong reactions. Understanding this cultural context is necessary to interpret the meme’s intent and impact.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
